<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`COMBAT_CHANNEL: number = 2147483646`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer COMBAT_CHANNEL = 2147483646;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant COMBAT_CHANNEL has the value 0x7FFFFFFE</p>
  <p>A channel reserved for <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Combat_Log" target="_blank">combat related log events</a> broadcast to the entire region.</p>
  <p>System generated messages to this channel will be from <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/COMBAT_LOG_ID" target="_blank">COMBAT_LOG_ID</a>.</p>
  <p>If the region settings allow for it (see <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetEnv" target="_blank">"restrict_combat_log"</a>), then scripts may write into this channel as well.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
